ook. <strong>Is it time to reach out\u2026 or is the past best left behind?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005690/extras/13954b789961179f84d0224a1589b557.poster.avif?t=1759773537\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005690/extras/13954b789961179f84d0224a1589b557.webp?t=1759773537\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=538 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Features</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy, <strong>relaxing scrapbooking</strong> activities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique puzzles</strong> on every page</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful artwork</strong> that brings memories to life\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the first chapter of a <strong>heartfelt story</strong> of friendship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get creative with <strong>cute</strong>\u00a0<strong>stickers</strong> to collect\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005690/extras/4f6167dc1855e2b071035fdfa2a85536.poster.avif?t=1759773537\" width=1170 height=532 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005690/extras/4f6167dc1855e2b071035fdfa2a85536.webm?t=1759773537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Quotes</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;It\u2019s sweet, and a little sad in all the right places, whilst providing just enough challenge.&quot;</i>  <br><strong>-\u00a0The Escape Room Gamer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_parag